            <ArticleTitle>Small spinal fractures in back pain patients.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>262-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Small fractures in the posterior elements of the spine were identified by stereoscopic radiography in 7 patients suffering from back pain. The clinical data on these 7 patients are presented.</AbstractText>
